OL,3,GNEWSAWatchdog praises force's stability
OL,4,Aand victim care
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force has been praised for
OL,7,Fkeeping people safe and its care for
OL,8,Fvictims but concerns over the
OL,9,Fconsistency of its investigations were
OL,10,Fraised.
OL,12,FHis Majesty's Inspectorate of
OL,13,FConstabulary and Fire & Rescue Services
OL,14,F(HMICFRS) rated Cumbria Police as
OL,15,F"good" in four areas: leadership, a
OL,16,Fdiverse and inclusive workplace,
OL,17,Fresponding to the public and
OL,18,Fsafeguarding children and adults.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
