OL,3,GNEWSAWatchdog praises force's stability
OL,4,Aand victim care
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report found four areas to be
OL,7,F"adequate", with the force being told
OL,8,Fto improve using its powers
OL,9,Fproportionately and managing fraud.
OL,11,FCumbria's Police, Fire and Crime
OL,12,FCommissioner (PCC) David Allen
OL,13,Fdescribed the results as "excellent",
OL,14,Fwith it being one of two forces that
OL,15,Fdid not receive a negative grading.
